{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","kind":"episodes","input":{"mediaId":34808,"seasonNumber":1},"checkedAt":1793472839836,"status":"ok","retryCount":0,"value":{"seasonNumber":1,"name":{"value":"Stagione 1","language":"it-IT"},"year":2006,"episodeCount":26,"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/stWw8ci28T0wRsH61wOr3Rdec3c.jpg","posters":[],"backgrounds":[],"episodes":[{"id":"792805","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":1,"title":{"value":"Episodio 1","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"犬神のようことともに魔物退治している川平啓太は、特命霊的捜査官・仮名史郎から悪霊退治の依頼を受ける。ターゲットの栄沢汚水は、生前にカップルを妬んでいた。そのために彼は、人を裸にできる能力を持つ魔王になっていたのだ。啓太は、そんな栄沢をおびき寄せるためにようこと仲睦まじいカップルを装うが…。","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2006-04-05","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/1ZKaPXSDVr9EuoeWbuFLDR22aw2.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/1ZKaPXSDVr9EuoeWbuFLDR22aw2.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/34808/season/1/episode/1"},{"id":"792806","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":2,"title":{"value":"Episodio 2","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"公園にいた啓太とようこの前に、川平家の宗家に仕えている犬神のはけが現れた。はけに連れられて宗家の屋敷に向かった啓太は、宗家から仕事を依頼される。さっそく大道寺に向かった啓太とようこは、宗家の古くから友人である寺の住職から事情を聞き始める。だが、そんな二人の前に、マッチョの男たちが突然現れて…。","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2006-04-12","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/xBpYACWpR04mXR6Y9FrI1Cwc0ND.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/xBpYACWpR04mXR6Y9FrI1Cwc0ND.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/34808/season/1/episode/2"},{"id":"792807","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":3,"title":{"value":"Episodio 3","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"啓太の従兄弟・薫の犬神たちは、屋内型温水プール・ウォーターガーデンに出没する妖怪の退治を依頼された。その温水プールを探っていたせんだんたちの前に現れた啓太とようこ。実は二人にも同じ依頼が入っていたのだった。そんな時、プールから出現したゲル状の生物。啓太とようこは難なく退治してしまうが…。","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2006-04-19","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/2Ur7TAslmysJ5MWhnPHOFqg081K.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/2Ur7TAslmysJ5MWhnPHOFqg081K.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/34808/season/1/episode/3"},{"id":"792808","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":4,"title":{"value":"Episodio 4","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"薫に仕えている犬神たちの一人・なでしこ。はけに言われて啓太のアパートに来たなでしこは、啓太の部屋に滞在することになった。期間は一週間。清楚で慎み深く家事が得意ななでしこにウットリする啓太。それが不満なようこ。一方、せんだんたち薫の犬神は、なでしこをそのまま追い出してしまおうと計画していた。","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2006-04-26","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/tPiHttck5l7kcxkjD4ECWnn3ea5.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/tPiHttck5l7kcxkjD4ECWnn3ea5.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/34808/season/1/episode/4"},{"id":"792809","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":5,"title":{"value":"Episodio 5","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"由緒正しき犬神使いの一族・川平家の末裔である川平啓太。彼は川平家始まって以来、犬神が一人も憑かなかった少年だった。しかし、そんな啓太の犬神になりたいものが現れた。その犬神の名前はようこ。彼女に食事の用意や肩揉み、夜伽などをさせようと考えた啓太は、さっそく主従の契りを結ぼうとするが…。","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2006-05-03","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/tORfoFw2jT66V8RpKCHhvrfMxYZ.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/tORfoFw2jT66V8RpKCHhvrfMxYZ.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/34808/season/1/episode/5"},{"id":"792810","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":6,"title":{"value":"Episodio 6","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"薫の犬神で最も幼く力も未熟な犬神・ともはね。ようこと戦った九人のうち弱点に見なされたともはねは、ようこを一人で倒そうと強力下剤入りのチョコレートケーキを用意した。さっそくケーキを持って啓太のアパートを訪れるともはね。だが、ようこはあいにくの留守。そんな時、啓太がそのケーキを勝手に食べてしまい…。","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2006-05-10","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/wHFlbs3wDkYs17Sa2Z5xwLUtDfk.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/wHFlbs3wDkYs17Sa2Z5xwLUtDfk.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/34808/season/1/episode/6"},{"id":"792811","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":7,"title":{"value":"Episodio 7","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"温泉に出掛ける用意を始めた啓太。それを知ったようこは、啓太とのデートだと思って大喜び。だが、これは温泉街にあるホテルの床などに穴を開けている妖怪を退治する依頼だった。妖怪が来るまでホテルを自由にしていた啓太とようこは、温泉旅行へと来ていたなでしこ、ともはね、たゆね、いぐさの四人と偶然出会い…。","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2006-05-17","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/z95Gf3ljb8SsNizBhn563XsfVtG.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/z95Gf3ljb8SsNizBhn563XsfVtG.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/34808/season/1/episode/7"},{"id":"792812","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":8,"title":{"value":"Episodio 8","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"河原崎先輩が、同人誌に描くマンガのヒロインのモデルにようこをぜひ、と頼んできた。ふさふさ尻尾を褒め称える河原崎。だが、尻尾を細くしたいようこに河原崎は、「狸のようにふくよかな尻尾」を言ってしまい激怒させてしまう。そんな時、人にコスプレさせる魔導具に追われている留吉が助けを求めにやって来て…。","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2006-05-24","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/mrCKJ1JMO4GPfCAv7AzGa7zV2Q3.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/mrCKJ1JMO4GPfCAv7AzGa7zV2Q3.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/34808/season/1/episode/8"},{"id":"792813","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":9,"title":{"value":"Episodio 9","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"薫の留守の間、犬神たちの面倒を見てくれと薫から頼まれた啓太とようこ。ただし、啓太が少しでもセクハラらしいことをしたら屋敷を即退場させると言い渡される。そのため、啓太にセクハラ行動をおこさせようと、ようこやたゆねたちはさまざまな罠を仕掛けてくる。だが、啓太は必死で欲望をセーブしていく。","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2006-05-31","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/oqiu20OGkHtcHStNdR7QnWgYScZ.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/oqiu20OGkHtcHStNdR7QnWgYScZ.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/34808/season/1/episode/9"},{"id":"792814","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":10,"title":{"value":"Episodio 10","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"明日は宗家の誕生会。はけから誕生会の案内を渡された啓太とようこ。一方の宗家の屋敷に派遣された薫の犬神たちは誕生会の準備に大忙し。そんな中、ずっと物思いにふけっているはけ。彼は宗家がまだ子供だった頃、死神から友人を救おうと犬神のはけと契約を交わした日＝宗家の誕生日の出来事を回想していた。","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2006-06-07","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/eGT0hgLTLVLCditvOdiybbRqKMV.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/eGT0hgLTLVLCditvOdiybbRqKMV.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/34808/season/1/episode/10"},{"id":"792815","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":11,"title":{"value":"Episodio 11","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"精霊能力活用比べ、略して「せいかつく」。古来より不定期に開かれる、霊能者関係の祭典に啓太は、川平家の代表として出ることになった。その当日、なぜかグッタリな啓太。そんな啓太の様子を自分が原因だと思ったようこたちは、なんとか啓太を元気づけようと努力する。だが、実は啓太の不調の原因は別にあった。","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2006-06-14","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/qxf4FYj5wGNPOHFtZjpMNyCZoi5.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/qxf4FYj5wGNPOHFtZjpMNyCZoi5.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/34808/season/1/episode/11"},{"id":"792816","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":12,"title":{"value":"Episodio 12","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"新堂財閥の令嬢・ケイと執事のセバスチャンから仕事を依頼された啓太とようこ。かつて新堂家は死神と契約をして巨万の富を手に入れたが、それと引き換えに新堂家の人間は二十歳になると死神に殺されてしまうという。明日二十歳の誕生日を迎えるというケイを死神から守るという仕事を引き受ける啓太たちだったが…。","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2006-06-21","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/hiV8y9xA4pnDAYM10DJjahq4eD7.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/hiV8y9xA4pnDAYM10DJjahq4eD7.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/34808/season/1/episode/12"},{"id":"792817","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":13,"title":{"value":"Episodio 13","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Keita and Yoko continue their fight against the shinigami Sea of Violence.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2006-06-28","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/jcEfbBHTBwelXMCx2r7uIPwX5ae.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/jcEfbBHTBwelXMCx2r7uIPwX5ae.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/34808/season/1/episode/13"},{"id":"792818","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":14,"title":{"value":"Episodio 14","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"新堂家にとりついていた死神を倒したせいで、不幸がスズナリになってやって来た啓太とようこは、貧乏な生活を送っていた。だが、ようこはそんな生活にもめげず、啓太のためにバイトを探していた。その一方で、ようこは今まで隠してきた秘密を啓太に打ち明けるべきか悩んでいた。その時、ようこの前にはけが現れて…。","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2006-07-05","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/5QOoRq1uqbbS2iWFgOGzdr2KUkD.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/5QOoRq1uqbbS2iWFgOGzdr2KUkD.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/34808/season/1/episode/14"},{"id":"792820","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":15,"title":{"value":"Episodio 15","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"貧乏な生活から抜け出せない啓太とようこのもとに、渡り猫の留吉と三年前、啓太に助けられたというタヌキが現れた。タヌキは三年前の恩返しにと啓太に惚れ薬を渡す。その惚れ薬を使って女の子たちからモテモテになろうと考えた啓太は、さっそく街に向かう。そんな啓太の行動に怒ったようこは、彼の後を追いかけるが…。","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2006-07-12","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/9VJOTG9hz9QrdrHniiIGprFdnnr.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/9VJOTG9hz9QrdrHniiIGprFdnnr.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/34808/season/1/episode/15"},{"id":"792819","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":16,"title":{"value":"Episodio 16","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"The Inukami and Keita are invited to Kaoru's summer villa.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2006-07-19","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/qsliLB4YyVpyooLR1Ns7BodCDMh.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/qsliLB4YyVpyooLR1Ns7BodCDMh.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/34808/season/1/episode/16"},{"id":"792821","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":17,"title":{"value":"Episodio 17","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Both Kaoru and Karina are sucked into Sekidosai's painting, and it's up to Keita, Yoko, and Nadeshiko to save them.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2006-07-26","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/5BF9hbdpKterp7OiJwXFmLDmwHC.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/5BF9hbdpKterp7OiJwXFmLDmwHC.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/34808/season/1/episode/17"},{"id":"792822","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":18,"title":{"value":"Episodio 18","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"啓太たちは赤道斎と対峙していた。自分たちの攻撃を軽くかわす赤道斎に、協力して大技を繰り出す啓太たち。赤道斎が啓太たちの攻撃を受ける振りをして、その力を逆に蓄えていたことに気づいた啓太たちは、元を断つことに成功する。だが、啓太たちから直接霊力を吸収し始めた赤道斎は、ついに現世へと復活してしまい…。","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2006-08-02","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/vup43grocqvjohJ7VXRJCWYseza.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/vup43grocqvjohJ7VXRJCWYseza.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/34808/season/1/episode/18"},{"id":"792823","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":19,"title":{"value":"Episodio 19","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"啓太たちのもとに転がってきた怪しいツボ。その中から出てきた薫の犬神たちが、啓太に序列を決めてほしいと迫ってきた。どうやら、序列で言い争っていた彼女たちを見た薫は、啓太に決めてもらうように言ったらしい。そんな啓太の前に、仮名がツボから出てきた。仮名によると、そのツボは願いを叶えてくれるツボらしく…。","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2006-08-09","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/zCVyziV0mgDfmTggRMtPjgfRjvG.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/zCVyziV0mgDfmTggRMtPjgfRjvG.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/34808/season/1/episode/19"},{"id":"792824","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":20,"title":{"value":"Episodio 20","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"唐突にごきょうやとのデートをフラノたちに頼まれた啓太。思いあたるところがあった啓太は、ようこの猛反対を退け、その申し出を受け入れることに。一方、変態下着泥棒の親方のもとに師匠が訪れた。薫の犬神たちの下着泥棒に失敗し続けているという話を聞いた師匠は、犬神たちから秘技「白布返し」で下着を奪っていき…。","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2006-08-16","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/k2k7lgOdhyumklb6NsKQ21bXU6r.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/k2k7lgOdhyumklb6NsKQ21bXU6r.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/34808/season/1/episode/20"},{"id":"792825","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":21,"title":{"value":"Episodio 21","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"封印の力が弱まり、伝説の妖怪・大妖狐が再び復活しようとしていた。その復活を阻止するため、現地に向かうせんだんたち。一方、薫から啓太を捜すように頼まれたともはねは、一生懸命に啓太を捜していた。だが、まったく啓太が見つからずに途方にくれるともはね。そんな時、ともはねはケイとセバスチャンに出会い…。","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2006-08-23","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/dqpURSNLQ1UbKH9uQE4ZKkTE6iJ.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/dqpURSNLQ1UbKH9uQE4ZKkTE6iJ.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/34808/season/1/episode/21"},{"id":"792826","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":22,"title":{"value":"Episodio 22","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"大妖狐を再び封印するため、薫や啓太をはじめとする川平家の一族、そしてようこやせんだんたち犬神が、大妖狐を封印している地へと集まって来た。宗家は皆の霊力を一同に合わせて破邪結界奥義「軍扇結界」を張ることを決める。だが、彼らの行った奥義「軍扇結界」は失敗し、ついに大妖狐が復活を果たしてしまう。","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2006-08-30","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/nSUQ9W0s8HOVw56NV7D2ANsODCF.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/nSUQ9W0s8HOVw56NV7D2ANsODCF.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/34808/season/1/episode/22"},{"id":"792827","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":23,"title":{"value":"Episodio 23","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"大妖狐と赤道斎は、町を破壊しながら戦いを始めた。せんだんたちに人々を避難させている中、なでしこと一緒に別行動をする薫。その薫の別行動とは、なぜか赤道斎を助けることだった。偶然、薫と出会った啓太は、大妖狐と赤道斎の戦っている場所に向かう薫の目的を知る。そんな薫に対して、啓太は怒りをぶつけるが…。","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2006-09-06","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/rfOA9B2ayTg99Q0n1Jr6LKB7nDc.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/rfOA9B2ayTg99Q0n1Jr6LKB7nDc.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/34808/season/1/episode/23"},{"id":"792828","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":24,"title":{"value":"Episodio 24","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Kaoru's past is revealed. Kaoru and his Inukami again battle Sekidosai, this time with the fate of the world, as well as Kaoru's life, on the line.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2006-09-13","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/me44vv9Fd93nJoQ3wjCs3ioJhTO.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/me44vv9Fd93nJoQ3wjCs3ioJhTO.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/34808/season/1/episode/24"},{"id":"792829","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":25,"title":{"value":"Episodio 25","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"赤道斎に乗り移っていた邪星によって身体を貫かれてしまった薫の姿は、この世から消えてしまう。呆然と立ち尽くすせんだんたちだったが、薫のため邪星に立ち向かう。そんな中、なでしこは封印していた強大な力を解放し、邪星に攻撃を仕掛ける。そして、なでしこは圧倒的な力で徐々に邪星を追い込んでいくが…。","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2006-09-20","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/jk6wHo25hNGMGWlVkD8zNzMqWjU.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/jk6wHo25hNGMGWlVkD8zNzMqWjU.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"